Spec: Android non-exportable device enrollment

Purpose:
  Generate Keystore-backed device requests and install explicitly confirmed owner-signed public certificates.

Owns:
  ./AndroidIdentity.java

Must:
  Authorize both SHA-256 signing and TLS prehashed ECDSA signing without exporting the key; prove both mechanisms before enrollment.
  Keep private keys in Android Keystore and sign CSRs without encoding the private key.
  Validate public chain, device profile, local key possession and database identity binding before certificate replacement.
  Never silently replace a missing existing identity or change the trusted owner root.
